Feature: CareLink Login # tests/ui/features/login.feature:1
  As a user of the CareLink application
  I want to be able to log in
  So that I can access my account
  Feature: CareLink Login  # tests/ui/features/login.feature:1

  @smoke @ui @tc01
  Scenario: User opens page and navigates to login  # tests/ui/features/login.feature:10
    Given I am using the "staging" environment      # tests/ui/steps/common_steps.py:113
    When I open the CareLink page                   # tests/ui/steps/login_steps.py:206
    Then I should see the CareLink homepage         # tests/ui/steps/login_steps.py:240
    When I click the sign in button                 # tests/ui/steps/login_steps.py:211
    Then I should see the login form                # tests/ui/steps/login_steps.py:250
    When I login as "standard" user                 # tests/ui/steps/login_steps.py:231
    Then I should be logged in successfully         # tests/ui/steps/login_steps.py:255

